20x more AI compute by 2030 still stalls if memory cannot feed it. This is AI Chips &amp; Data Centres, Episode 23. SK Heinrichs President Onhion put that forecast on the table at SETX 2026 in Seoul. AGA carried his account of context length, about 128,000 tokens in 2024. Around 1 million now, and a path toward 100 million. That working set spills off high bandwidth memory and DRAM onto

