signed by Jensen Huang, plus a 64 gigabyte RDIM on a 10 nanometer-class 6th generation

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:44.220
process, a 256 gigabyte 3DS RDIM, and a 128 gigabyte MRDIM.

00:01:45.314 --> 00:01:50.854
Semi-conductor engineering carried Quadrix General Purpose Neural Processor, sold as configurable

00:01:50.854 --> 00:01:56.754
IP with one instruction stream and one instruction set for Scalar, Vector, and Matrix work,

00:01:57.134 --> 00:01:59.334
program from C++ and Python.

00:01:59.914 --> 00:02:05.734
Each processing element in the Chimera Core has a 32-bit ALU, a configurable multiply

00:02:05.734 --> 00:02:11.034
accumulate bank, local register file SRAM, and a path to its neighbors.

00:02:11.714 --> 00:02:14.914
Both that local SRAM and the L2 are software managed.

00:02:15.454 --> 00:02:17.494
There is no hardware cache in the description.

00:02:17.494 --> 00:02:24.512
Bolt Graphics has finished a first round of testing on Zeus, HPC Wire reported, a test

00:02:24.512 --> 00:02:29.672
chip for hardware accelerated physics in HPC, digital twins, and video rendering.

00:02:30.212 --> 00:02:34.952
The finished GPU is not expected to leave TSMC until 2028.

00:02:35.752 --> 00:02:37.712
Bolt also opened an office in Taiwan.

00:02:38.392 --> 00:02:45.072
