00:04:41.629 --> 00:04:46.569
Ampersand wants solid state transformers to take the edge off AI data center power spikes,

00:04:47.109 --> 00:04:48.129
EE Times reported.

00:04:48.749 --> 00:04:53.949
The toolkit in that piece is batteries, 800 volt DC conversion and microgrid control.

00:04:54.549 --> 00:04:59.229
Yesterday, the open question on high bandwidth memory was, who gets the allocation and at

00:04:59.229 --> 00:04:59.789
