00:05:12.669 --> 00:05:18.549
said Micron has signed 26 long-term supply agreements covering more than 35% of projected revenue

00:05:18.549 --> 00:05:26.329
through 2030. Remaining performance obligations are about $150 billion. More than 75% of

00:05:26.329 --> 00:05:31.909
