00:05:32.629 --> 00:05:38.149
The same report said tight supply in HBM and server DRAM could last until 2028.

00:05:38.849 --> 00:05:47.089
Musk has also said Tesla cut planned LPDDR5 on the AI-5 chip from 144GB to 96, and planned

00:05:47.089 --> 00:05:52.109
LPDDR6 on the AI-6 chip from 216GB to 144.

