00:06:54.669 --> 00:06:59.709
The accelerators sit in a locally operated AI factory, packaged by builders including

00:06:59.709 --> 00:07:06.809
Cisco, Dell Technologies, HPE, Lenovo, and SuperMicro. The frame, the model, and the operations

00:07:06.809 --> 00:07:12.389
log are meant to stay under the city's control. In Cote Door, Akila and ThinkDeep combine

00:07:12.389 --> 00:07:18.849
sensor data, infrastructure data, and historical records in a sovereign twin on Nemotron, Omniverse,

00:07:19.149 --> 00:07:24.909
and Accelerated Computing, with Cosmos still planned for the video. The estate is more than 500

00:07:24.909 --> 00:07:30.489
public buildings. Documents search went from weeks to minutes. Total operating costs fell by

00:07:30.489 --> 00:07:37.389
10%. The scale target is 30%, and that target is not yet a measured result. In the Milan region,

00:07:37.389 --> 00:07:44.229
Galene.ai, Dell Technologies, and TD Synex are standing up a local AI factory, starting

00:07:44.229 --> 00:07:49.929
in Sinicello, Balsamo, with a plan to add four more municipalities. The latency claim

00:07:49.929 --> 00:07:55.549
